commit 627cdac0ad468e4deed382e78d601306a517d7af

C03: the dangling-alternative question must say only that part arrived and ask what it refers to (DIALOGUE1517)

DIALOGUE1515 measured that «o en la de siempre.» and its variants asked what the fragment refers to («¿De qué otra cosa estás hablando?») but never said that only that part arrived, which the criterion requires; the validator accepted the referent question alone. It now requires both («sólo me llegó…», «llegó cortado» and the referent question), with a corrected retry that asks for both explicitly; greetings and guessed actions stay rejected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


